#
# Protects the least-privilege workflow-permissions gate hardened in PR #248
# (deferred follow-up from #241). These entries auto-request review from and
# document ownership of the gate script and its test, so a single self-merged
# PR can no longer silently weaken the check that enforces least-privilege
# workflow `permissions:` grants.
#
# NOTE: This is informational/notification-only today. It has no blocking
# effect until a branch-protection ruleset on `main` enables
# `require_code_owner_review`. See docs/release-hygiene.md (§4) for why that
# enforcement is deferred until a second collaborator exists.
